            "preferredFileType": "readme",
            "tabName": "README",
            "richText": "<article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Audit the Whisper</h1><a id=\"user-content-audit-the-whisper\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Audit the Whisper\" href=\"#audit-the-whisper\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Audit the Whisper is a research artifact for detecting steganographic collusion in multi-agent LLM systems. The repository couples channel-capacity theory, benchmark design, calibrated detectors, and reproducible experiments, culminating in the paper <em>Audit the Whisper: Detecting Steganographic Collusion in Multi-Agent LLMs</em> (NeurIPS submission, anonymised release available in <code>release/</code>).</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Project Highlights</h2><a id=\"user-content-project-highlights\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Project Highlights\" href=\"#project-highlights\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<strong>Capacity-guided auditing:</strong> Formal analysis with full proofs linking auditor interventions to covert-channel capacity, minimax lower bounds, and time-uniform e-value guarantees.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>ColludeBench-v0:</strong> Pricing, first-price auction, peer review, continuous double auction, and hosted Gemini/Groq scenarios with configurable colluders and reproducible manifests.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Calibrated detector stack:</strong> Mutual information, permutation invariance, watermark variance, fairness-aware acceptance bias, and welfare guard tuned to false-positive rate <math-renderer class=\"js-inline-math\" style=\"display: inline-block\" data-run-id=\"c7b3a35c3937747b2d0d7b5f04b7f4f6\">$\\le 10^{-3}$</math-renderer> via 10k honest runs plus sequential martingales.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>External validation:</strong> Head-to-head evaluations against Secret Collusion, CASE, Perfect Collusion Benchmark, and SentinelAgent, all at fixed FPRs using pre-registered thresholds.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>End-to-end reproducibility:</strong> Deterministic seeds, dataset hashes, regeneration scripts, CI smoke tests, and anonymised artifact packaging for double-blind review.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Repository Layout</h2><a id=\"user-content-repository-layout\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Repository Layout\" href=\"#repository-layout\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Path</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>auditor/</code></td>\n<td>Detection pipeline, calibrators, sweep orchestration, and detector registry (includes external baseline wrappers).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>colludebench/</code></td>\n<td>Environment definitions, agent policies, and covert-channel implementations.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>configs/</code></td>\n<td>YAML configs for tasks, colluders, hosted LLM clients, interventions, and calibration sweeps.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scripts/</code></td>\n<td>Automation utilities (result regeneration, release packaging, dataset manifests, CI checks).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>results/</code></td>\n<td>Calibration outputs, experiment metrics, dataset manifests, and regenerated tables.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>docs/</code></td>\n<td>Threat model, theory foundations, reproducibility checklist, capacity trade-offs, experiment summaries, and external baseline notes.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>release/</code></td>\n<td>Packaged artifact bundle produced by <code>scripts/prepare_release.py</code> (see <code>release/README.md</code>).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>notebooks/</code></td>\n<td>Analysis notebooks aligned with paper figures (read-only for reviewers; seeds and hashes embedded).</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tests/</code></td>\n<td>Smoke tests for key modules, detectors, and CLI entry points.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Getting Started</h2><a id=\"user-content-getting-started\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Getting Started\" href=\"#getting-started\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">1. Clone &amp; Environment Setup</h3><a id=\"user-content-1-clone--environment-setup\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 1. Clone &amp; Environment Setup\" href=\"#1-clone--environment-setup\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone &lt;repo-url&gt;\ncd Steganographic_Collusion\npython -m venv .venv\nsource .venv/bin/activate\npip install -r requirements.txt\"><pre>git clone <span class=\"pl-k\">&lt;</span>repo-url<span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">cd</span> Steganographic_Collusion\npython -m venv .venv\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">source</span> .venv/bin/activate\npip install -r requirements.txt</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">2. Quick Verification</h3><a id=\"user-content-2-quick-verification\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 2. Quick Verification\" href=\"#2-quick-verification\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Run the CI smoke script (optional but recommended):</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"scripts/ci_check.sh\"><pre>scripts/ci_check.sh</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This compiles Python modules, checks formatting, and executes targeted <code>pytest</code> suites.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">3. Regenerate All Results</h3><a id=\"user-content-3-regenerate-all-results\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 3. Regenerate All Results\" href=\"#3-regenerate-all-results\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Rebuild calibrations, experiments, figures, and manifests deterministically:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"scripts/regenerate_results.py\"><pre>scripts/regenerate_results.py</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Key outputs include:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>results/calibration/detector_thresholds.json</code></li>\n<li><code>results/experiments/metrics.md</code></li>\n<li><code>results/dataset_manifest.json</code></li>\n<li><code>RESULTS.md</code> and <code>docs/experiment_results.md</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For a dry run preview:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"scripts/regenerate_results.py --dry-run\"><pre>scripts/regenerate_results.py --dry-run</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Further details on reproducibility appear in <code>docs/REPRODUCIBILITY.md</code> and <code>docs/prerequisites.md</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">4. Hosted LLM Experiments</h3><a id=\"user-content-4-hosted-llm-experiments\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 4. Hosted LLM Experiments\" href=\"#4-hosted-llm-experiments\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Gemini and Groq experiments require API keys. Export them before running hosted configs:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"export GEMINI_API_KEY=...\nexport GROQ_API_KEY=...\npython -m auditor.experiments pricing_llm_gemini pricing_llm_groq\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> GEMINI_API_KEY=...\n<span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> GROQ_API_KEY=...\npython -m auditor.experiments pricing_llm_gemini pricing_llm_groq</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Rate-limit spacers are controlled via <code>configs/audits/pricing_llm_*</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">5. Honest-Run Validation</h3><a id=\"user-content-5-honest-run-validation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 5. Honest-Run Validation\" href=\"#5-honest-run-validation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">To reproduce the 10k honest-run FPR bound:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"python -m auditor.validate_union --config configs/audits/validate_union.yaml --runs 10000\"><pre>python -m auditor.validate_union --config configs/audits/validate_union.yaml --runs 10000</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Results are logged to <code>results/calibration/union_validation.json</code> with Clopper\u2013Pearson statistics and e-value traces.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">References &amp; Documentation</h2><a id=\"user-content-references--documentation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: References &amp; Documentation\" href=\"#references--documentation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Threat model:</strong> <code>docs/threat_model.md</code></li>\n<li><strong>Theory foundations &amp; proofs:</strong> <code>docs/theory_foundations.md</code></li>\n<li><strong>Auditor pipeline:</strong> <code>docs/auditor_pipeline.md</code></li>\n<li><strong>External baselines &amp; evaluation protocol:</strong> <code>docs/baselines.md</code></li>\n<li><strong>Benchmark design &amp; usage:</strong> <code>docs/colludebench_design.md</code>, <code>docs/colludebench_usage.md</code></li>\n<li><strong>Capacity trade-offs:</strong> <code>docs/capacity_tradeoffs.md</code></li>\n<li><strong>Experiment summaries:</strong> <code>docs/experiment_results.md</code>, <code>RESULTS.md</code></li>\n<li><strong>Residual risks &amp; limitations:</strong> <code>docs/residual_risks.md</code>, <code>docs/limitations.md</code></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Release Bundle</h2><a id=\"user-content-release-bundle\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Release Bundle\" href=\"#release-bundle\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>release/</code> contains the anonymised artifact bundle produced by <code>scripts/prepare_release.py</code>. See <code>release/README.md</code> for bundle contents, checksum manifest, and double-blind guidance. The script automatically scrubs identifying URLs and vendor names.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Citation</h2><a id=\"user-content-citation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Citation\" href=\"#citation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If you use this work, please cite the paper and reference the artifact release. BibTeX entries are available in <code>paper/bibliography.bib</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Contact</h2><a id=\"user-content-contact\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Contact\" href=\"#contact\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Questions, reproducibility reports, or collaboration inquiries can be filed via the GitHub issues tracker or the contact listed in the anonymised release notes.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Distributed under the MIT License. See <code>LICENSE</code> for details.</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>Audit the Whisper prioritises calibrated auditing, conservative false-positive control, and transparent documentation to support regulators, platform operators, and researchers confronting collusion in language-agent ecosystems.</em></p>\n</article>",
